% (all-time, n=21); top finds archive-crawler / benchmark-due-diligence / academic-verify; costs nightly $1.02 Â· anthropic MTD $10.12 Â· project $21.11; noise 65.\n\n### Explicitly deferred (named, not built)\n- The **force-directed knowledge graph** (data sources: shared `domain_path`, `github_network_parent` lineage, `prov_edges`, `hh_events`) â€” recorded in `DASHBOARD.md` as the next wave, per Stage-0 G1.\n\n**Run command:** `.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe aurora_dashboard.py` â†’ http://127.0.0.1:5001"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":920,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10999,"cache_read_input_tokens":33329,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10999},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b722427c-dc5f-4b5b-a456-dad4ce023aa6","uuid":"9f28c861-c4a9-4c6f-a963-150817a33e7f","request_id":"req_011Cc1Hk3UbhCF3mRe3sCqJJ"}
